,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"d5007f06-9868-4797-b56b-524cd2db08a7","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":621054854,"PostDateInt":1765931284000,"PostDate":"2025-12-17T08:28:04","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"SRAM技术经理","OrgId":2639803,"Org":"研发","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·合肥市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、技术开发与验证：负责SRAM相关技术(α/β/γ issue, standby leakage issue, RSNM/WSNM/HSNM issue, mismatch issue)的工艺开发、测试验证及优化，包括SRAM Compiler或instance的电路设计、仿真验证、版图布局布线指导，NTO的测试分析，确保器件性能符合规格要求。同时，需持续优化工艺流程，提升产品质量和产能。\n2、项目管理与进度控制：制定阶段性目标，管理SRAM技术项目的全周期(SRAM function verify￫SRAM HTOL Qualification pass)进度，包括计划、实施和监控，确保项目按时交付，并协调资源解决技术难题。\n3、团队管理与协作：领导技术团队，促进跨部门协同（如与设计、制造团队合作），提供技术指导和培训，推动团队能力提升。此外，需定期向高层报告进展，确保信息透明化。\n4、数据分析与流程优化：通过数据分析驱动优化决策，编写技术文档和操作规范，支持生产线导入和标准化流程建设。\n\n\n温馨提示：\n公司在招聘过程中不收取任何费用，求职环节以任何理由收费的行为均为诈骗！","Require":"1、微电子、物理、电子相关专业，硕士及以上学历\n2、>10年以上SRAM开发/分析相关经验\n3、28/22纳米工艺技术相关经验及产品验证\n4、具有团队合作精神，踏实诚信，责任心强\n5、有SRAM团队管理经验者优先考虑","ClassificationOne":"研发技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"10年及以上","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4